      "content": "it doesn't feel like exhaustion though. it feels more like... finished. like the story is actually done. there's no more color left in the world for me, and trying to pretend there is just feels exhausting and fake. it's like i'm just a hollow shell walking around waiting for something that isn't coming back.",
